  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 09}这样，能运送{F2 01 03 01}“圣火”{F2 01 01 01}的\n范围就扩大了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 07 01 0B 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E1 04}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}大家，听我说！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我刚才一直在观察\n那些抬神轿的Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:1:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我们带着{F2 01 03 01}“圣火”{F2 01 01 01}时，\n它们似乎会比平时走得更快！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}嗯？怎么回事？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 0B}它们抬着神轿时，\n原本移动得很慢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}可各位带着{F2 01 03 01}“圣火”{F2 01 01 01}时，\n它们似乎就会\n小跑着移动。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}原来如此……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F2 01 03 01}也就是说，“圣火”{F2 01 01 01}的力量\n使肌肉活跃起来了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 64 09}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}呵，有意思！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AE 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}有意思个头，笨蛋。\n就是说比刚才更难逃掉了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8A 11}又要逃吗？\n真次郎，你是那种人吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e704_235.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
